<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL"
                  xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI"
                  xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC"
                  xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI"
                  xmlns:folio="https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/bpmn"
                  id="Definitions_Process_CRDM_Needs" targetNamespace="https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/workflows"
                  exporter="folio-assistant" exporterVersion="1">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collaboration_Process_CRDM_Needs">
    <bpmn:participant id="Participant_Process_CRDM_Needs" name="CRDM Phase 1 — needs" processRef="Process_CRDM_Needs"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_CRDM_Needs" name="CRDM Phase 1 — needs" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>Identify the stakeholders, synthesise a needs statement from the sources, and loop until the BA and the stakeholders both recognise it. The loop is the phase: a needs statement nobody confirmed is an agent's summary, not a requirement.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_Process_CRDM_Needs">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_BA" name="BA / Feature Requestor">
        <bpmn:documentation>The single review here is what GW_Needs is literally named for — "BA approves?" — even though Lane_Stakeholders' confirmation sits between this task and that gateway in the flow; the phase's own documentation makes clear the loop needs both, so reading the gate label alone would miss half of what it takes to exit it.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:extensionElements><folio:role ref="business-analyst"/></bpmn:extensionElements>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>BA_ReviewNeeds</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_Agent" name="Agent">
        <bpmn:documentation>Drafts the needs statement but never decides it is right — A_Synthesise is the sole target when GW_Needs loops back — and this process's own documentation calls an unconfirmed synthesis "an agent's summary, not a requirement," which is exactly what this lane alone produces before the two lanes below it look at it.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:extensionElements><folio:role ref="authoring-agent"/></bpmn:extensionElements>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_Process_CRDM_Needs</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>A_Stakeholders</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>A_Synthesise</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>GW_Needs</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_Process_CRDM_Needs</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_Stakeholders" name="Stakeholders">
        <bpmn:documentation>The task itself carries no documentation of its own, so this lane's entry is the only place recording what "confirm" means in Phase 1: recognising the synthesised needs statement as actually theirs, immediately before the loop gate — not, as in the later data-model phase, judging a cardinality, because there is no model yet to have one.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:extensionElements><folio:role ref="stakeholder"/></bpmn:extensionElements>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>S_ConfirmNeeds</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_Process_CRDM_Needs" name="Phase begins"/>
    <bpmn:task id="A_Stakeholders" name="Phase 1: Identify
stakeholders">
      <bpmn:documentation>The agent asks the BA who is affected by this change.
The BA knows the domain — the agent does not guess.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements><folio:skill ref="crdm-requirements-workflow"/></bpmn:extensionElements>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="A_Synthesise" name="Phase 1: Synthesise
needs from sources">
      <bpmn:documentation>From the chat, issue, uploads and library sources, write a clear, jargon-free statement of what is needed and why, tied to a concrete workflow. Post it on the GitHub issue, not in chat, and ask the requester and stakeholders to review it.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements><folio:skill ref="crdm-requirements-workflow"/></bpmn:extensionElements>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="BA_ReviewNeeds" name="Review synthesised
needs statement">
      <bpmn:documentation>The BA reviews what the agent synthesised and
checks it against what they actually need.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements><folio:skill ref="crdm-requirements-workflow"/></bpmn:extensionElements>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="S_ConfirmNeeds" name="Confirm needs
statement">
      <bpmn:documentation>Stakeholders confirm, on the issue, that the needs statement says what they need — or say what to change. A stakeholder's judgement; an agent does not record it for them.</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="GW_Needs" name="BA approves?">
      <bpmn:documentation>The BA's answer to the needs statement. `revise` goes back to synthesising needs from the sources; `yes` completes the phase.</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_Process_CRDM_Needs" name="Phase complete"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_1" sourceRef="Start_Process_CRDM_Needs" targetRef="A_Stakeholders"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_2" sourceRef="A_Stakeholders" targetRef="A_Synthesise"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_3" sourceRef="A_Synthesise" targetRef="BA_ReviewNeeds"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_4" sourceRef="BA_ReviewNeeds" targetRef="S_ConfirmNeeds"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_5" sourceRef="S_ConfirmNeeds" targetRef="GW_Needs"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_6" name="revise" sourceRef="GW_Needs" targetRef="A_Synthesise"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_7" name="yes" sourceRef="GW_Needs" targetRef="End_Process_CRDM_Needs"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_Process_CRDM_Needs">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_Process_CRDM_Needs" bpmnElement="Collaboration_Process_CRDM_Needs">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Participant_Process_CRDM_Needs" bpmnElement="Participant_Process_CRDM_Needs" isHorizontal="true">
        <dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1466" height="584" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Lane_BA_Process_CRDM_Needs" bpmnElement="Lane_BA" isHorizontal="true">
        <dc:Bounds x="190" y="80" width="1436" height="170" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Lane_Agent_Process_CRDM_Needs" bpmnElement="Lane_Agent" isHorizontal="true">
        <dc:Bounds x="190" y="250" width="1436" height="170" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Lane_Stakeholders_Process_CRDM_Needs" bpmnElement="Lane_Stakeholders" isHorizontal="true">
        <dc:Bounds x="190" y="420" width="1436" height="170" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_Start_Process_CRDM_Needs" bpmnElement="Start_Process_CRDM_Needs">
        <dc:Bounds x="310" y="317" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_A_Stakeholders" bpmnElement="A_Stakeholders">
        <dc:Bounds x="510" y="295" width="140" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_A_Synthesise" bpmnElement="A_Synthesise">
        <dc:Bounds x="710" y="295" width="140" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_BA_ReviewNeeds" bpmnElement="BA_ReviewNeeds">
        <dc:Bounds x="910" y="125" width="140" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_S_ConfirmNeeds" bpmnElement="S_ConfirmNeeds">
        <dc:Bounds x="1110" y="465" width="140" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_GW_Needs" bpmnElement="GW_Needs" isMarkerVisible="true">
        <dc:Bounds x="1310" y="310" width="50" height="50" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Shape_End_Process_CRDM_Needs" bpmnElement="End_Process_CRDM_Needs">
        <dc:Bounds x="1510" y="317" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_1" bpmnElement="SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_1">
        <di:waypoint x="346" y="335" />
        <di:waypoint x="510" y="335" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_2" bpmnElement="SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_2">
        <di:waypoint x="650" y="335" />
        <di:waypoint x="710" y="335" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_3" bpmnElement="SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_3">
        <di:waypoint x="850" y="335" />
        <di:waypoint x="880" y="335" />
        <di:waypoint x="880" y="165" />
        <di:waypoint x="910" y="165" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_4" bpmnElement="SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_4">
        <di:waypoint x="1050" y="165" />
        <di:waypoint x="1080" y="165" />
        <di:waypoint x="1080" y="505" />
        <di:waypoint x="1110" y="505" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_5" bpmnElement="SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_5">
        <di:waypoint x="1250" y="505" />
        <di:waypoint x="1280" y="505" />
        <di:waypoint x="1280" y="335" />
        <di:waypoint x="1310" y="335" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_6" bpmnElement="SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_6">
        <di:waypoint x="1335" y="360" />
        <di:waypoint x="1335" y="585" />
        <di:waypoint x="780" y="585" />
        <di:waypoint x="780" y="375" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Edge_SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_7" bpmnElement="SF_Process_CRDM_Needs_7">
        <di:waypoint x="1360" y="335" />
        <di:waypoint x="1510" y="335" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
